t","image_mobile":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/ChatGPT_Image_17_juil._2025_18_59_54.png","image_ratio_mobile":"landscape","content_position_mobile":"items-end justify-end","text_alignment_mobile":"left","highlighted_text":"text","highlighted_scribble":"circle","color_text":"#ffffff","color_highlight":"#fde047","gradient_highlight":"","color_overlay":"#171717","overlay_opacity":30}},"image_YjV46m":{"type":"image","settings":{"subheading":"<em>Installation<\/em>","heading":"<strong>Simple & rapide<\/strong>","link":"","invert_subheading_heading":true,"image":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/Visuel_lifestyle_accessoires_11.png","image_ratio":"square","content_position":"md:items-end md:justify-start","text_alignment":"left","image_mobile":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/Visuel_lifestyle_accessoires_11.png","image_ratio_mobile":"portrait","content_position_mobile":"items-end justify-end","text_alignment_mobile":"right","highlighted_text":"text","highlighted_scribble":"circle","color_text":"#ffffff","color_highlight":"#fde047","gradient_highlight":"","color_overlay":"#171717","overlay_opacity":30}}},"block_order":["image_F4YCrC","image_xx4dkb","image_EFfCin","image_YjV46m"],"settings":{"heading":"<strong>L’alarme pensée pour votre quotidien<\/strong>","heading_size":"title-md","heading_alignment":"text-left md:items-end md:flex-row","heading_tag":"h2","subheading":"","description":"<p>Simple à installer, facile à utiliser et <strong>sans abonnement<\/strong>, nos alarmes s’adaptent à votre mode de vie.<br\/><br\/>Découvrez les 4 atouts qui font la différence au moment de <strong>protéger votre foyer.<\/strong><\/p>","button_label":"","button_link":"","button_external":false,"button_icon":true,"highlighted_text":"scribble","highlighted_scribble":"basic-underline","color_text":"","color_background":"","gradient_background":"","color_highlight":"","gradient_highlight":"","color_button_text":"","color_button_background":"","color_button_gradient":"","padding_top":72,"padding_bottom":0,"divider":false,"full_width":false,"rounded":false,"enable_parallax":true}},"rich_text_pCad4B":{"type":"rich-text","blocks":{"heading_x9EmNT":{"type":"heading","settings":{"heading":"Pourquoi choisir ce système d’alarme sans abonnement ?","heading_size":"title-lg tracking-heading","heading_tag":"h2","highlighted_text":"none","highlighted_scribble":"circle"}},"text_jfW3Cy":{"type":"text","settings":{"text":"<p>Votre maison mérite d’être protégée, même quand vous êtes absent.<br\/><br\/>Ce système d’alarme a été conçu pour les particuliers qui cherchent <strong>une solution simple, fiable et sans engagement<\/strong>. Pas besoin de travaux ni de technicien : <strong>vous l’installez vous-même, en quelques minutes<\/strong>, et recevez directement les alertes sur votre téléphone.<\/p><p><\/p>","text_font":"body","text_size":"subtext-md","text_max_size":32,"text_line_height":1.6,"text_letter_spacing":0,"text_capitalize":false,"secondary_color":false,"highlighted_text":"none","highlighted_scribble":"circle"}}},"block_order":["heading_x9EmNT","text_jfW3Cy"],"name":"t:sections.rich-text.name","settings":{"text_alignment":"center","text_alignment_mobile":"center","heading":"","heading_size":"title-md","heading_alignment":"text-left md:items-end md:flex-row","heading_width":"small","heading_tag":"h2","subheading":"","description":"","button_label":"","button_link":"","button_external":false,"button_icon":true,"highlighted_text":"none","highlighted_scribble":"circle","color_text":"","color_background":"","gradient_background":"","color_highlight":"","gradient_highlight":"","color_button_text":"","color_button_background":"","color_button_gradient":"","padding_top":72,"padding_bottom":100,"divider":false,"narrow":true,"rounded":false}},"product-details":{"type":"product-details","blocks":{"collapsible_tab-1":{"type":"collapsible_tab","settings":{"icon":"none","iwidth":"custom","icon_width":24,"heading":"Connectivité","content":"<h6>Connexion <\/h6><p>Wi-Fi 2.4 GHz <\/p><h6>Connexion GSM <\/h6><p>(carte SIM – en option) Non disponible pour Vigilia WiFi<\/p><h6>Notification en temps réel via application mobile<\/h6><p>Envoi de SMS (via GSM | Nécessite une carte Sim)<\/p><h6>Compatibilité assistants vocaux <\/h6><p>(Google Home \/ Alexa)<\/p><p>Toutes les gammes sauf la gamme <\/p>","metafields":"","text_size":"text-base"}},"collapsible_tab-2":{"type":"collapsible_tab","settings":{"icon":"none","iwidth":"custom","icon_width":24,"heading":"Alimentation & Autonomie","content":"<h6>Batterie de secours intégrée<\/h6><p>Centrale Vigilia : 4 heures<\/p><p>Centrale Touch : 3 à 6 heures<\/p><p>Centrale Touch XL : 24 heures<\/p><p>Centrale Élite : 12 heures<\/p><h6>Fonctionnalité GSM<\/h6><p>Fonctionnement même en cas de coupure de WiFi (Nécessite une carte Sim)<\/p><p>Non disponible pour Vigilia WiFi<\/p>","metafields":"","text_size":"text-base"}},"collapsible_tab-3":{"type":"collapsible_tab","settings":{"icon":"none","iwidth":"custom","icon_width":24,"heading":"Commande & pilotage","content":"<h6>Contrôle à distance <\/h6><p>via l’application Daewoo Home Connect <\/p><h6>Notifications push ou SMS <\/h6><p>en cas d’alerte (Nécessite une carte Sim)<\/p><h6>Activation\/désactivation à distance <\/h6><h6>Création de scénarios automatisés<\/h6>","metafields":"","text_size":"text-base"}},"collapsible_tab-4":{"type":"collapsible_tab","settings":{"icon":"none","iwidth":"custom","icon_width":24,"heading":"Évolutivité & compatibilité","content":"<h6>Système évolutif<\/h6><p>Ajoutez jusqu’à 90 accessoires par centrale (sauf gamme Vigilia qui est limitée à 60 accessoires)<\/p><h6>Compatibilité avec tous les accessoires<\/h6><p>Détecteurs, claviers, télécommandes, badges, sirènes, etc. (Suivre les compatibilités Vigilia\/Touch et Elite)<br\/>Caméras et Maison Connectée : Compatible toutes gammes <\/p><h6>Système 100 % personnalisable<\/h6><p>Selon vos besoins - Achetez que ce qui est nécessaire et complétez au fur et à mesure<\/p>","metafields":"","text_size":"text-base"}},"collapsible_tab_V9XUpH":{"type":"collapsible_tab","settings":{"icon":"none","iwidth":"custom","icon_width":24,"heading":"Sécurité & détection","content":"<h6>Sirène intégrée <\/h6><p>Vigilia = 85dB<\/p><p>Touch = 95 dB<\/p><p>Touch XL = 100 dB<\/p><p>Élite = 85 dB<\/p><h6>Détection d’arrachement <\/h6><p>(centrale arrachée = alerte) <\/p><h6>Communication cryptée entre centrale et accessoires <\/h6><h6>Modes de surveillance<\/h6><p><br\/>Total, Partiel ( Maison ), Désarmée<\/p><p>Fonction SOS en cas d’agression au domicile<\/p><h6>Programmation de scénarios et délais personnalisés<\/h6><p>Programmation de scénarios et Temporisation ( Pour entrée ou sortir du domicile )<\/p><h6><\/h6><h6><\/h6>","metafields":"","text_size":"text-base"}},"specification":{"type":"specification","repeater":"{{ product.metafields.custom.icon_inclus_dans_le_pack.value }}","settings":{"icon":"{{ block.repeater.icon_inclus_dans_le_pack.value }}","heading":"{{ block.repeater.titre_de_l_icon.value }}","text_size":"text-sm"}}},"block_order":["collapsible_tab-1","collapsible_tab-2","collapsible_tab-3","collapsible_tab-4","collapsible_tab_V9XUpH","specification"],"settings":{"style":"with-background","open_first_row":true,"specifications_heading":"Inclus dans le pack","heading":"Détails produit","heading_size":"title-md","heading_alignment":"text-left md:items-end md:flex-row","heading_tag":"h2","subheading":"","description":"","button_label":"","button_link":"","button_external":false,"button_icon":true,"highlighted_text":"none","highlighted_scribble":"circle","color_text":"","color_background":"","gradient_background":"","color_highlight":"","gradient_highlight":"","color_button_text":"","color_button_background":"","color_button_gradient":"","padding_top":28,"padding_bottom":28,"divider":false,"full_width":false,"rounded":false}},"scrolling_banner_DjLpk3":{"type":"scrolling-banner","blocks":{"image_aGmhPx":{"type":"image","settings":{"image":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/ARME_4.png","ic